research
# Only docs/tutorials/ ships into the build context — read at build time to
# bake in-app tutorial pages (apps/web/lib/brain/tutorial-content.ts). A bare
# "docs" exclusion cannot be selectively re-included per Docker's own rule
# ("not possible to re-include a file if a parent directory is excluded"),
# so this excludes each direct child of docs/ individually and re-includes
# just the one subdirectory that's actually needed.
docs/*
!docs/tutorials
*.md
!README.md
!docs/tutorials/*.md
